WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:03.959
For the tracker, compare "validate the form" with:

00:00:04.238 --> 00:00:08.173
"Require a contact name and one preferred contact method.

00:00:08.684 --> 00:00:11.877
If either is missing, explain the missing field and keep

00:00:11.923 --> 00:00:12.934
the entered values.

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:16.719
Do not save an incomplete inquiry." This is a proposed

00:00:16.765 --> 00:00:19.575
example; the real owner must approve the fields.

00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:23.186
It tells the agent what to accept, reject, and show the

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:23.720
visitor.

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:27.156
It also creates several test cases without prescribing

00:00:27.249 --> 00:00:28.236
every line of code.
